  "description": {
   "en": "In the ultimate dating game mayhem, Jerry Route's virtual love life takes center stage! \n\nBattling fainting spells due to his feeble stats, Jerry's three brothers crank up the competition for his affection. Enter the swoon-worthy crown prince Karyan and the fourth prince Ilya, who both vie for Jerry's attention. It's a hilarious, heart-fluttering quest as Jerry dodges the overprotective antics of friends and family, navigating the game while encountering an amusing array of characters. \n\nWill Jerry find true love amidst the chaos, or will his frailty throw a comical wrench into his romantic escapades?"
  },
